{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e395a6af-2301-83a1-a6fb-ba1953eadad3",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T10:57:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yusuf Tran",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:54:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:54:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, Greg. Quick one, I hope. I'm trying to put up a fence and I keep getting sent in circles on the website. Do I need a permit for a fence or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:54:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, most fences need one. What are you looking to put up, and where's the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "346 Old Beach Road, over by Easton's Beach. It's for the dog. She's a little escape artist, she slips out the gate every time somebody opens the door, and I'm tired of chasing her down the road in my socks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:54:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What kind of fence, how tall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:54:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Black aluminum. About four and a half feet tall. So, like, not huge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:54:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Four and a half feet, that's still going to be in the range where you'd want to apply. Don't assume it's too short to count."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:55:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but is there a height where it stops needing one? Like under four feet, under three? Because my brother-in-law said anything under five is fine, and I'd really rather not fill out forms for a dog fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:55:19-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I wouldn't go by that. Your brother-in-law could be thinking of another town. Here the safe answer is you check with us before you build, because the rules can depend on the zone and where it sits on the lot. I'd rather you ask now than take it down later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So that's a yes, basically. Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:55:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For what you're describing, yes, plan on applying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:55:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. How close to the property line can it go? I was going to just run it right along the edge so I get all the yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's one of the things the review looks at. There's usually a setback or a rule about which side the finished face goes on, and I don't want to throw a number at you off the top of my head. Do you have a survey or a plat of the lot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:56:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got something from when we bought. A survey, I think. It's in the, uh, the cabinet. The one in the dining room, where we keep the good glasses. Anyway, yeah, somewhere in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:56:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, dig that out. Mark where you want the fence, the gate, and how far in from the line. Bring it or send it with the application and the staff will tell you what works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:56:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I do the application online, or do I have to come down there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can start with the form from the city site, or stop by the office. Either way, we'd look at it and get back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:56:55-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. How long does that take? Because I'd like to get this done soon. Also, I just found out they're letting the kids out early tomorrow, early dismissal, so I'm scrambling to be home. Nobody told us until this morning. So the dog's going to be loose in the house with everybody underfoot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:57:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that's a hassle. Timing on permits varies, but for a basic fence it's usually not a long wait if the paperwork is complete. A clean drawing helps a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:57:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So survey, drawing, the height, the material, how far from the line. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:57:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your name and address, and the contractor's information if you're hiring someone. If you're doing it yourself, just say so on the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:57:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Doing it myself. Fine. Alright, I'll find that survey tonight. Thanks, Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:57:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Call back if you hit a snag with the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:57:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Bye."
    }
  ],
